01:12:53.670 --> 01:12:58.620
<v Jane Doe>So when I get a chance to just, like, go annihilate some little, like, nine year olds, I will.
<v Jane Doe>所以只要有机会去蹂躏一下那些九岁大的孩子，我肯定会去。

01:12:58.620 --> 01:13:02.370
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周再见，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

